brand: Salomon
model name: Sleepwalker
model year: 2027
AUD price: $769.99
availability: Pre-order (Estimated May 1, 2026)
available lengths: 148cm, 151cm, 153cm, 155cm, 158cm, 155cm Wide, 158cm Wide
board type: Freestyle
flex: 3/10 (1=soft, 10=stiff)
flex description: Soft flex, forgiving, easy to control, ideal for beginners or freestyle riders, excels in park tricks and buttering
rider level: Beginner-Intermediate
shape: Twin (symmetrical tip and tail, equal performance riding forward or switch)
camber type: Rock Out Camber
camber description: Flat between the bindings provides stability, camber near the feet adds response, and rocker at the tip and tail enhances pressability
sidecut type: Equalizer Rad Sidecut (combination of Equaliser and Radial radii for agility, straight lines and short radius)
width: Standard, Wide
mounting pattern: 2x4 inserts
laminate: BA MD Fiberglass (medium density, light and lively)
core technology: Popster (core milled inside of inserts, board flexes more naturally, energy transferred to nose and tail more efficiently for extra pop)
resin: 30% Bio-Based Resin (made 30% of plant material, high performance with low environmental impact)
core material: Aspen Strong Core (CNC-cut high-density Aspen wood strips in insert and rail zones for impact resistance and consistent flex)
sidewall: Royal Rubber Pads (soft rubber blocks in high-pressure areas of ABS sidewalls to absorb vibrations and dampen hard impacts)
edge bevel: Freestyle Edge Bevel (1.5 degree base edge bevel for edge hold and forgiveness on rails and boxes)
base: Sintered Base (high-quality, balanced speed and wax retention)
base finish: Medium Stone Finish
wax: Natural Wax
riding style: Park, jib, rail pressing, side hits, creative freestyle
